    #[23] ∃N. ∀n. ∀x1. N ≤ n ⟶ x1 ∈ real_closed_interval (min x 0) (max x 0) ⟶ abs (sum (s ∩ {0..n}) (λi. a i * x1 ^ i) - f x1) < e
  ← inst_exists_goal N goal=23
    #[24] ∀n. ∀x1. N ≤ n ⟶ x1 ∈ real_closed_interval (min x 0) (max x 0) ⟶ abs (sum (s ∩ {0..n}) (λi. a i * x1 ^ i) - f x1) < e
  ← introduction n,x1 goal=24
